'''''Hintighernia''''' is a genus of [[Tapejaridae|tapejarid]] [[pterosaur]] from the [[Early Cretaceous]] of the [[Cambridge Greensand]], United Kingdom. The type species is '''''H. edingerae'''''. It was named from a cranium originally referred to the genus ''[[Ornithostoma]]''.<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Pêgas |first=Rubi V |last2=Bandeira |first2=Kamila L N |last3=Naish |first3=Darren |last4=Holgado |first4=Borja |date=2026-11-01 |title=A tapejarid pterosaur from the Cambridge Greensand (Cretaceous of England), with comments on its neuroanatomy and the biogeography of the group |url=https://doi.org/10.1093/zoolinnean/zlag162 |journal=Zoological Journal of the Linnean Society |volume=208 |issue=3 |pages=zlag162 |doi=10.1093/zoolinnean/zlag162 |issn=0024-4082}}</ref>

